            "review_title": "Review at La Sirena Saigon",
            "review_text": "TravelingFoodie\nMiami, Florida10823 contributions\n0\nIt was a good experience\nDec 2024 • Friends\nWe stopped by this highly-rated restaurant for lunch while in the area. The decor and ambiance were lovely, and it seems like a place that likely gets busy in the evenings. The menu features some live seafood and other intriguing dishes.\n\nWe particularly enjoyed the razor clams and found the black pepper crab quite tasty. The sauce on the cockles was excellent, but unfortunately, about half of them didn’t open, and the rest were a bit dry.\n\nOverall, it was an enjoyable experience.\nRead more\nWritten December 8, 2024",
