            "review_text": "Jacopo S\n1 contribution\n0\nIt sucks.\nAug 2024 • Family\nWe arrived and ordered. I asked for fish and chips and it arrived after 30 minutes and it was cold. Along with that, I asked for more chips for the family and we got some shrimp with coconut sauce; I say verbatim words to the staff “we ordered French fries” or we ordered some chips and he says ok. The second time comes with the same dish and the same thing happens. Third time he always arrives with the same plate and tells us that the chips were not good for eating them, then we do not hang them. At the beginning we asked the staff for water, which is very difficult to communicate and understand. The water comes hot. Despite literally drinking four glasses it was marked on the bill at the price of 120,000 dong, or 5 euros. And the other food we ate was not well done, and it was basically just fish. Total 1 star because 0 you could not. I do not veil Recommendation 👎.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten August 18, 2024",
